      "note": "Reviewed the exploit receipt and call trace, all six factory-creation traces, clone and implementation runtimes, and the commit-pinned reproduction. The forged permit and withdrawals execute through six EIP-1167 clones. Their immutable runtimes select four implementations: 0x2ce186c52cf150000bf8ad2b4679d4ad619395cd, 0xe5fbef79727d8db175281feaccfa49dcfdc6bcf3, 0x8eed729352382fb06a5ffea72d2618d7eb7da89a, and 0xd0f02b9deb434ec999022d465c5e56842448069b. The target rows retain the earliest affected clone for each distinct implementation hash and failure mode. Each implementation hash is unchanged from its first implicated clone deployment through the pre-exploit state, and the disassembled implementations contain no DELEGATECALL, SELFDESTRUCT, or CREATE2 instruction. The receipt records exact final transfers of 4,477.722585 USDC, 3,609.950462 USDT, and 24,182.560323103174179821 LIX; the trace records 2.603255642603989317 ETH leaving the vaults. The pre-exploit LIX/WETH pool at block 25391315 had sqrtPriceX96 21675775653759264873121937677713369."
